<title>UK: SBC sets call and put warrants on Swiss franc/mark.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call and put warrants on Swiss franc/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 40 million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the Swiss franc/mark exchange rate, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	  1.22 DEM    1.26 DEM	 3.80 PCT     94.30 X</p>
<p> PUT B	   1.22 DEM    3.69 DEM	 0.40 PCT     32.20 X</p>
<p> CALL C	  1.20 DEM    2.11 DEM	 2.80 PCT     56.30 X</p>
<p> PUT D	   1.20 DEM    2.40 DEM	 1.00 PCT     49.50 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 13.NOV.96-15.SEP.97   PAYDATE	12.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1.1876 DEM</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
